<title>CHINA: China 1996 corn exports up at 160,000 tonnes.</title>
<headline>China 1996 corn exports up at 160,000 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China exported 160,000 tonnes of corn in 1996, against 1995's 110,000 tonnes, customs figures showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>Exports in December alone were 10,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>China imported 440,000 tonnes tonnes of corn in 1996, down by 91.4 percent from the same period last year, customs figures showed.</p>
<p>China imported 5.18 million tonnes of corn in 1995.</p>
</text>
